====== ZyXEL NBG6716 ======
Also known as //ZyXEL Media Router AC 1750 Ultimate Performance// or //ZyXEL EMG2926-Q10A//. The hardware is very similar to the [[toh:tp-link:tl-wdr7500|TP-Link TL-WDR7500]], but with a large NAND flash, internal antennas, and an upright design. The factory firmware is based on OpenWrt/LEDE (the [[#oem_bootlog]] below shows 2013-11-22, r2211 - LEDE 17.01.0 was r3205), customized by Zyxel & Qualcomm, and includes StreamBoost (fq_codel-based QOS).

{{media:zyxel:nbg6716_general_view.png?200|NBG6716}}

